WEBVTT

00:00:00.671 --> 00:00:01.472
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.427 --> 00:00:04.139
<v><b>A:</b></v> I went to New York last week.

00:00:04.387 --> 00:00:06.514
<v><b>B:</b></v> Wow! Did you like it?

00:00:08.472 --> 00:00:09.250
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:10.168 --> 00:00:13.613
<v><b>A:</b></v> The weather was terrible – it rained every day.

00:00:13.652 --> 00:00:15.923
<v><b>B:</b></v>  Oh no! What a pity!

00:00:16.248 --> 00:00:17.240
What did you do?

00:00:19.202 --> 00:00:20.018
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:20.971 --> 00:00:22.881
<v><b>A:</b></v> We went to a musical on Broadway.

00:00:23.126 --> 00:00:25.864
<v><b>B:</b></v> Fantastic! What musical was it?

00:00:27.794 --> 00:00:28.584
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:31.667
<v><b>A:</b></v> I lost my phone on the first day.

00:00:31.903 --> 00:00:34.098
<v><b>B:</b></v> Really? How awful!

00:00:34.429 --> 00:00:35.606
How did you lose it?